# Questfolio shell & map rules

- Do not change map layout, poster, icon art, or marker coordinates unless the user explicitly asks.
- Library Classroom is a shared shell (`LibraryClassroom.tsx`); cities differ by colour + content only.
- Portal learner shell stays standard; do not redesign quest UI. Admin overlays are additive only.
- Trade sword UI/placement stays stable; author scenario content and reward params, not new map geometry.
- Never copy Coral Ledger Bay / Purple City curriculum into other cities.
- For repeating portal/sword authorship, use `/author-portal` or `/author-sword` skills.
